flowchart TD
    A[Canonical Parquet batch] --> B[Validate fields and order; hash payload]
    B --> C[Begin transaction; check applied_batches]
    C --> D{Existing batch ID?}
    D -->|Same hash| E[Commit read transaction; NO_OP]
    D -->|Different hash| F[Rollback; reject conflict]
    D -->|New| G[Check watermark and batch boundary]
    G --> H[Filter positive; dedup; anti-join existing edges]
    H --> I[Allocate unseen nodes; insert new edges]
    I --> J[Increment degree from inserted edges]
    J --> K[Write ledger; commit; APPLIED]
    G -->|Invalid boundary| F
    I -->|Exception| F
    J -->|Exception| F
